X: 1
T: Da-Doo
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: Seymour's tale of the total eclipse, from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody
N: (channel 1) of a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7931), key Ab major as in the source,
N: so the da-doo riff needs no accidentals; the low riff answers sit in recorder
N: range and the descant's highest calls reach F5. Chords fitted from the
N: accompaniment (Ab7 blues with Db7, Fm7 and Eb7). The swung eighths of the
N: 12/8 source are straightened; pitches are the source's. One pass: the da-doo
N: riff verses and their answers (source bars 5-27); the B natural and Gb of the
N: last bar are the source's chromatics.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=120
M: 4/4
